{"synopsis":"Circle ke-9, yang disebut sebagai tataran demigod. Kunci terakhir menuju ke sana adalah jantung Naga Merah, Valdrova.\n\n\"Tak kusangka, calon tunanganku sendiri yang datang untuk membunuhku.\"\n\nEntah mengapa, Valdrova menyerahkan jantungnya sendiri tanpa perlawanan sama sekali.\n\n\"...apa ini? Perasaan apa ini? Kenapa rasanya begitu tidak nyaman?\"\n\nAh... aku benar-benar telah melihatnya. Keputusasaan Valdrova yang begitu dalam dan sudah berlangsung begitu lama, yang bahkan kebencianku sendiri tak sanggup dibandingkan dengannya.","alternative_title":"내가 죽인 드래곤과 결혼했다","author":"Jelling","artist":"Bonsai Tree","chapters":[{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"ch_15","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-08-04"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"ch_14","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-08-04"},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"ch_13","title":"Chapter 13","date":"2026-08-04"},{"number":"12","chapter":"12","slug":"ch_12","title":"Chapter 12","date":"2026-08-04"},{"number":"11","chapter":"11","slug":"ch_11","title":"Chapter 11","date":"2026-08-04"},{"number":"10","chapter":"10","slug":"ch_10","title":"Chapter 10","date":"2026-08-04"},{"number":"9","chapter":"9","slug":"kc_ch_i-married-the-dragon-i-killed_9","title":"Chapter 9","date":"2026-08-04"},{"number":"8","chapter":"8","slug":"kc_ch_i-married-the-dragon-i-killed_8","title":"Chapter 8","date":"2026-07-28"},{"number":"7","chapter":"7","slug":"kc_ch_i-married-the-dragon-i-killed_7","title":"Chapter 7","date":"2026-07-21"},{"number":"6","chapter":"6","slug":"kc_ch_i-married-the-dragon-i-killed_6","title":"Chapter 6","date":"2026-07-14"},{"number":"5","chapter":"5","slug":"kc_ch_i-married-the-dragon-i-killed_5","title":"Chapter 5","date":"2026-07-14"},{"number":"4","chapter":"4","slug":"kc_ch_i-married-the-dragon-i-killed_4","title":"Chapter 4","date":"2026-07-14"},{"number":"3","chapter":"3","slug":"kc_ch_i-married-the-dragon-i-killed_3","title":"Chapter 3","date":"2026-07-14"},{"number":"2","chap